{
  "$schema": "https://weknora.tencent.com/schemas/workflow-v1.json",
  "version": "1.0",
  "type": "weknora_workflow",
  "exported_at": "2026-09-22T11:48:00.000Z",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "知识库质量自检与规范合成工作流",
    "description": "提炼检索词并查询知识库后，由大模型评估资料完备度：若资料充足则启动 doc-synthesizer 深度合成技术规范，若资料欠缺则智能兜底并指明缺项。",
    "version": 2,
    "schema_version": 2
  },
  "workflow": {
    "version": 2,
    "schema_version": 2,
    "viewport": {
      "x": 60,
      "y": 120,
      "zoom": 0.75
    },
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "start",
        "name": "接收提问",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 240
        },
        "config": {}
      },
      {
        "id": "llm-extract-keywords",
        "type": "llm",
        "name": "提炼检索关键词",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 280,
          "y": 240
        },
        "config": {
          "system_prompt": "你是一个专业的检索关键词提取助手。你的任务是从用户提问中提炼用于知识库检索的核心关键词。",
          "prompt": "根据用户问题：{{input.query}}\n\n请提炼出 3-5 个最核心的检索关键词。\n严格遵循以下规则：\n1. 仅提取主语、核心检测方法与主题名词（例如：混凝土 RCM法 抗氯离子渗透 检测设备 规格）；\n2. 严禁展开具体的技术参数、型号、量程或数值；\n3. 关键词之间用单个空格隔开，直接输出关键词，严禁输出任何解释、标点或多余文字。",
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "retrieval-main",
        "type": "knowledge-retrieval",
        "name": "检索技术知识库",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 560,
          "y": 240
        },
        "config": {
          "top_k": 5,
          "query_template": "{{nodes.llm-extract-keywords.text}}",
          "knowledge_base_ids": [
            "2e4fd4f8-4ad2-47b1-8398-4aeab84ca6e0"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "decision-eval-docs",
        "type": "llm-decision",
        "name": "评估资料完备度",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 840,
          "y": 240
        },
        "config": {
          "prompt": "请严格评估用户提问与知识库检索到的参考资料：\n【用户提问】：{{input.query}}\n【检索资料】：\n{{nodes.retrieval-main.text}}\n\n请判断当前资料是否足以支撑生成一份严谨完整的技术规范或方案：\n如果资料中包含具体的检测方法、标准条文、技术指标或设备规格等核心信息，只返回【资料充分】；\n如果未检索到有效内容，或资料严重零散缺失，无法满足技术规范要求，只返回【资料不充分】。",
          "choices": [
            "资料充分",
            "资料不充分"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tool-doc-synthesizer",
        "type": "tool",
        "name": "规范文档深度合成",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 1140,
          "y": 120
        },
        "config": {
          "kind": "skill",
          "arguments": {},
          "tool_name": "",
          "skill_name": "doc-synthesizer",
          "task_template": "用户提问：\n{{input.query}}\n\n知识库检索到的参考资料：\n{{nodes.retrieval-main.text}}\n\n【禁止输出】系统和沙盒内部的链接，比如resource://和skill://开头的链接\n请基于以上检索到的资料，结合用户的提问，整理并生成一份结构完整的技术规范方案文档。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "end-doc-report",
        "type": "end",
        "name": "输出正式技术规范",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 1440,
          "y": 120
        },
        "config": {
          "text_template": "{{nodes.tool-doc-synthesizer.text}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "llm-fallback-advisory",
        "type": "llm",
        "name": "审慎解答与缺项指引",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 1140,
          "y": 360
        },
        "config": {
          "system_prompt": "你是一名严谨的技术标准顾问。当资料不足时，需实事求是解答，杜绝任何参数编造与幻觉。",
          "prompt": "用户提问：{{input.query}}\n\n知识库现有参考片段（可能不完整或仅为局部条文）：\n{{nodes.retrieval-main.text}}\n\n请按以下要求回复用户：\n1. 明确告知用户：知识库中暂未检索到完全覆盖该提问的成套标准文件；\n2. 基于检索到的现有片段，如实说明当前已知内容与参考指标；\n3. 提示用户建议补充准确的标准号、规程名称或具体型号重新提问，以便精确匹配。",
          "temperature": 0.4
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "end-fallback-advisory",
        "type": "end",
        "name": "输出咨询与补充指引",
        "branch_mode": "first_match",
        "position": {
          "x": 1440,
          "y": 360
        },
        "config": {
          "text_template": "{{nodes.llm-fallback-advisory.text}}"
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "id": "edge-start-to-extract",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "llm-extract-keywords",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 0,
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-extract-to-retrieval",
        "source": "llm-extract-keywords",
        "target": "retrieval-main",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 0,
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-retrieval-to-decision",
        "source": "retrieval-main",
        "target": "decision-eval-docs",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 0,
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-decision-to-synthesizer",
        "source": "decision-eval-docs",
        "target": "tool-doc-synthesizer",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 0,
        "is_default": false,
        "condition": {
          "mode": "all",
          "items": [
            {
              "variable": "nodes.decision-eval-docs.data.choice",
              "operator": "eq",
              "value": "资料充分"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-synthesizer-to-end",
        "source": "tool-doc-synthesizer",
        "target": "end-doc-report",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 0,
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-decision-to-fallback",
        "source": "decision-eval-docs",
        "target": "llm-fallback-advisory",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 1,
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-fallback-to-end",
        "source": "llm-fallback-advisory",
        "target": "end-fallback-advisory",
        "source_handle": "right",
        "target_handle": "left",
        "order": 0,
        "is_default": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
